      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 7.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "evening let's get started okay, is the form from the front desk all filled in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.28,
      "end_seconds": 17.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "I think so, I handed it in at the counter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.78,
      "end_seconds": 21.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "what's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.89,
      "end_seconds": 29.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "okay, so it's being very confused i thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.76,
      "end_seconds": 38.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "right, has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.38,
      "end_seconds": 48.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Erm, about... well, about three months. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.85,
      "end_seconds": 52.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.9,
      "end_seconds": 59.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "a seven out of ten, I suppose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.77,
      "end_seconds": 65.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Any severe thirst and passing lots of urine as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.0,
      "end_seconds": 75.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "Right, yes, about the same, about two weeks. I've also had bone pain, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.37,
      "end_seconds": 79.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.28,
      "end_seconds": 82.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.45,
      "end_seconds": 86.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I follow. A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.38,
      "end_seconds": 102.16,
      "duration_seconds": 13.78,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I quit smoking around ten years ago. I live with my elderly mother. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.23,
      "end_seconds": 108.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.63,
      "end_seconds": 118.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "I have heart disease. Erm, I have an irregular heartbeat, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.82,
      "end_seconds": 121.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.06,
      "end_seconds": 125.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Eczema, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.34,
      "end_seconds": 129.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.83,
      "end_seconds": 138.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.2,
      "end_seconds": 144.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.87,
      "end_seconds": 147.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.23,
      "end_seconds": 162.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "A few quick ones: chest pain, fall or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.42,
      "end_seconds": 167.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.25,
      "end_seconds": 173.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Right, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.82,
      "end_seconds": 178.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "well, uh, no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.14,
      "end_seconds": 184.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.83,
      "end_seconds": 187.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 190.97,
      "end_seconds": 197.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "here are the numbers, doctor. Blood pressure 93 over 59, pulse is 101 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.62,
      "end_seconds": 199.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.71,
      "end_seconds": 205.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.55,
      "end_seconds": 222.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.4,
      "end_seconds": 225.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.33,
      "end_seconds": 245.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "You are dehydrated and drowsy with a slow, odd rhythm on the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.27,
      "end_seconds": 254.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "right, that's the the examination finished"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.1,
      "end_seconds": 272.93,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "let me just check I've got this right you've had being very confused for about three months, and no fall or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.02,
      "end_seconds": 279.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "mm, um, that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.37,
      "end_seconds": 285.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I'm going to order an ECG, for hypercalcaemia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.06,
      "end_seconds": 290.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "how long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.63,
      "end_seconds": 313.63,
      "duration_seconds": 23.0,
      "text": "I want urgent blood tests done, that's for confusion and polyuria. We'll begin with sodium chloride 0.9%, 1 litre, over one hour, single dose. That's for dehydration. You need hospital fluids and treatment now. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.73,
      "end_seconds": 317.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.53,
      "end_seconds": 321.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.75,
      "end_seconds": 327.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I, I'll book it on my way out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.51,
      "end_seconds": 334.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.34,
      "end_seconds": 347.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.13,
      "text": "So, um, I take the sodium chloride 0.9%, 1 litre, over one hour and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.61,
      "end_seconds": 353.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.41,
      "end_seconds": 358.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "No, um, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.42,
      "end_seconds": 361.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Have a good day."
